      "cooked": "<p>Hi Community <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/waving_hand.png?v=14\" title=\":waving_hand:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":waving_hand:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>We are building a School ERP on ERPNext and need a skilled Frappe / ERPNext UI Developer to help us polish and modernize the interface.</p>\n<p>We do NOT want a full redesign — just a clean, modern and professional looking UI that creates a strong first impression for school principals.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/check_mark.png?v=14\" title=\":check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Scope of Work</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Improve overall ERPNext UI look &amp; feel</li>\n<li>Better spacing, typography, and color consistency</li>\n<li>Sidebar &amp; navigation refinement</li>\n<li>Create a simple but impressive dashboard\n<ul>\n<li>Student stats</li>\n<li>Attendance overview (donut or bar)</li>\n<li>Few quick status cards</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Should be mobile friendly</li>\n<li>Must be update-safe (no core file hacking)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/check_mark.png?v=14\" title=\":check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Requirement</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Must have prior ERPNext / Frappe UI experience</li>\n<li>Show previous ERPNext work / screenshots / links</li>\n<li>Knowledge of Frappe charts preferred</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/check_mark.png?v=14\" title=\":check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Deliverables</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Theme / Custom App format preferred</li>\n<li>Installable on multiple ERPNext sites</li>\n<li>Clean code + brief explanation</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/three_o_clock.png?v=14\" title=\":three_o_clock:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":three_o_clock:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Timeline: 10–15 days<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/money_bag.png?v=14\" title=\":money_bag:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":money_bag:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Budget: ₹15,000 (Milestone based)</p>\n<p>If interested, please reply here or DM with:<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/one.png?v=14\" title=\":one:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":one:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Short intro<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/two.png?v=14\" title=\":two:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":two:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Previous ERPNext UI work<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/three.png?v=14\" title=\":three:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":three:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Timeline<br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/four.png?v=14\" title=\":four:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":four:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Cost expectations</p>\n<p>Theme must be delivered as a Custom App (Theme App).</p>\n<p>No ERPNext core modifications. Must be update-safe.</p>\n<p>Thank you <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/blush.png?v=14\" title=\":blush:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":blush:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
